      },
      {
       "l": "C",
       "t": "$S_n=\\frac{n(u_1+u_n)}{2}$"
      },
      {
       "l": "D",
       "t": "$S_n=nu_1+nd$"
      }
     ],
     "correct": "C",
     "expl": "Công thức $S_n=\\frac{n(u_1+u_n)}{2}=\\frac{n}{2}[2u_1+(n-1)d]$."
